#. type: Title #
#: docs/features/page-refresh.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Page refresh (sync vs refresh)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/page-refresh.md:8
msgid ""
"Satellite UI keeps data fresh with two distinct verbs. Do not conflate them "
"with PWA / installer “reload”, which updates shell assets only."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/page-refresh.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verbs"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/page-refresh.md:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Verb        | When                                                       | What happens                                                                                                                   |\n"
"| ----------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| **sync**    | Habitat reconnect, tab visible again, Offline sync toast retry | Flush outbox; modules that flushed call `refreshAll` (see [offline platform](../guide/offline-platform.md))                    |\n"
"| **refresh** | Header **Refresh** button or touch pull-to-refresh         | Re-run the page’s `reload*` / list fetch (online `withOfflineCache` already network-fetches). Same handler for button and pull |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/page-refresh.md:16
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Core Principles"
msgid "Principles"
msgstr "核心原则"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/page-refresh.md:22
msgid ""
"**Limited auto**: keep sync + existing live channels (chat `stream.*`, "
"`conversation.updated`, `pomodoro.active.changed`). No global list polling. "
"No unconditional `refreshAll` of every module on visibility when the outbox "
"is empty."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/page-refresh.md:22
msgid ""
"**Manual refresh required** on product list surfaces so multi-device / agent "
"edits can be pulled on demand."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/page-refresh.md:22
msgid ""
"**Interaction dimension** (see [ui-dimensions](../../.agent/rules/ui-"
"dimensions.md)): pointer uses a header button; touch also gets pull-to-"
"refresh on the primary list. Shell kind does not lock the affordance."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/page-refresh.md:22
msgid ""
"**Out of scope**: Habitat fan-out for every CRUD entity; React Query; turning "
"the offline-sync toast into a page refresh control."
msgstr ""

